{"batch_number":50,"batch_size":80,"cases":[{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-01-sentence-0016","input":"当启用 `RelaxedServiceNameValidation` 特性门控时， Service 对象名称可以以数字开头。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names.md","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-0016","split":"documentation_01"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-01-sentence-0020","input":"例外情况是当为 Service 对象启用了 `RelaxedServiceNameValidation` 特性门控时，这允许 Service 名称以数字开头。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names.md","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-0020","split":"documentation_01"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-02-sentence-0015","input":"在指令式对象配置中，kubectl 命令指定操作（创建，替换等），可选标志和至少一个文件名。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/object-management.md","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-0015","split":"documentation_02"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-02-sentence-0025","input":"对象配置需要额外的步骤来编写 YAML 文件。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe