Pod 不具备配置了网络的运行时沙箱时，`PodReadyToStartContainers` 状况将被设置为 `False`。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0181","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0183","input":"在 Pod 生命周期的末期阶段，Pod 的沙箱由于以下原因被销毁时：节点重启时 Pod 没有被驱逐对于使用虚拟机进行隔离的容器运行时，Pod 沙箱虚拟机重启时，需要创建一个新的沙箱和全新的容器网络配置。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0183","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0227","input":"`Unknown`（未知） : 诊断失败，因此不会采取任何行动。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0227","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0234","input":"如果容器不提供就绪态探针，则默认状态为 `Success`。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0234","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0248","input":"如果你的容器需要在启动期间加载大型数据、配置文件或执行迁移，你可以使用启动探针。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0248","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0251","input":"关于 kubelet 如何处理 Pod 删除的更多信息，请参见 Pod 终止。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0251","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0266","input":"许多容器运行时遵循容器镜像内定义的 `STOPSIGNAL` 值，如果不同，则发送容器镜像中配置的 STOPSIGNAL，而不是 TERM 信号。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0266","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0281","input":"如果 Pod 中的容器之一定义了 `preStop` 回调且 Pod 规约中的 `terminationGracePeriodSeconds` 未设为 0， `kubelet` 开始在容器内运行该回调逻辑。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0281","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0282","input":"如果 `preStop` 回调在体面期结束后仍在运行，kubelet 将请求短暂的、一次性的体面期延长 2 秒。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0282","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-03-sentence-0341","input":"这种传统行为在很长一段时间内都是默认设置的，但给 Kubernetes 用户带来了一些问题，尤其是在大规模部署场景中。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle.md","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-0341","split":"documentation_03"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0002","input":"你可以在 Pod 集合中运行代码，无论该代码是为云原生环境设计的，还是被容器化的老应用。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0002","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0004","input":"如果你使用来运行你的应用， Deployment 可以动态地创建和销毁 Pod。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0004","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0020","input":"Ingress 不是一种 Service，但它可用作集群的入口点。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0020","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0046","input":"这一机制为 Service 的部署和演化提供了较高的灵活性。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0046","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0078","input":"默认情况下，一旦现有 EndpointSlice 都包含至少 100 个端点，Kubernetes 就会创建一个新的 EndpointSlice。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/8668f30367fe6aeec80d515e364552b45c278f99/content/zh-cn/docs/concepts/services-networking/service.md","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-0078","split":"documentation_04"},"source_id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"kubernetes-docs-zh-cn-v1/page-04-sentence-0122","input":"有关详细信息，请参阅无头服务。","